  "description": "Lightweight feature flag management for .NET applications. Supports in-memory, file-based, and Azure App Configuration providers. Features percentage rollouts, user targeting, time-based activation, and real-time updates. Includes ASP.NET Core middleware and DI extensions.",
  "id": "PrimusSaaS.FeatureFlags",
